e_item_assets/steam/apps/3536080/extras_big/5a6a780300da972cc35850d976772c8b.avif?t=1762171269 width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campus bullying? Trade in power and color? The academy is filled with dark transactions that cannot be seen in the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536080/extras/df337a4db76f993891646908f33734f9.avif?t=1762171269\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536080/extras_big/df337a4db76f993891646908f33734f9.avif?t=1762171269 width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship? Admire? Four characters will engage in intense and thrilling survival with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536080/extras/176dac8f9e5e0c1f6721911ba5fd301d.avif?t=1762171269\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536080/extras_big/176dac8f9e5e0c1f6721911ba5fd301d.avif?t=1762171269 width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will lead yourself into the situation, completely breaking through all darkness, and the true light will be welcomed by your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536080/extras/75f0a3ce632e26b2ebe11d37019134e0.avif?t=1762171269\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536080/extras_big/75f0a3ce632e26b2ebe11d37019134e0.avif?t=1762171269 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The United Nations report points out that 246 million children worldwide suffer from school bullying every year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When encountering bullying, please raise your fists and boldly resist, only resistance can end the violence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May world peace be without tears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["zhuzi1","\u8a00\u6eaa"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536080/c98e643771f7047ec39112de86e588a9b7506559/header.jpg?t=1762171269","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3536080/867513/53f63dfa967fe13b3d0ff7993bc50a230e5dffb2/1750858963/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744702486","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3536080/867513/53f63dfa967fe13b3d0ff7993bc50a230e5dffb2/1750858963/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744702486","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3536080/867513/53f63dfa967fe13b3d0ff7993bc50a230e5dffb2/1750858963/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744702486","id":257124475,"name":"EPV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257124475/2035f2dd366ff4c6733aee1fb78cd24319998244/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744702486"}],"name":"Dark Cage1\uff1aReincarnation For Salvation","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"\u91cc\u4e16\u754c\u5b66\u96621\uff1a\u7ec8\u672b\u8f6e\u56de\u6551\u8d4e - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$4.99</span> $3.99 USD","packageid":1248231,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":399}],"title":"Buy Dark Cage1\uff1aReincarnation For Salvation"}],"packages":[1248231],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 7/8.1/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> P